38,0.0599977,0.20142695,-0.05302774,0.00640979,-0.03449964,0.03496372,0.03091955,0.01980233,0.05880726,-0.00418902,-0.02396889,0.13771912,0.05457169,-0.05790387,0.0546373,0.01300201,0.05560747,0.01176516,0.02735201,-0.01668463,-0.01592829,-0.02135501,0.01580168,0.07989584,-0.06545972,-0.02520912,-0.08012081,0.0364211,-0.01384606,-0.00993767,-0.02709315,0.02754734,-0.00943193,0.0163672,0.04603935,-0.05624873,-0.04864964,-0.0509669,0.03247096,0.05905591,-0.02321298,0.0318154,0.09655058,0.04048114],"last_embed":{"hash":"mndnxs","tokens":429}}},"last_read":{"hash":"mndnxs","at":1756394261995},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1756394247680,"size":21569,"at":1756394259271,"hash":"mndnxs"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,12],"#Purpose/Why:":[13,17],"#Purpose/Why:#{1}":[14,17],"#Core Explanation:":[18,37],"#Core Explanation:#{1}":[19,20],"#Core Explanation:#Provide a clear, concise, and comprehensive explanation of the concept, including its definition, key characteristics, and how it works.":[21,37],"#Core Explanation:#Provide a clear, concise, and comprehensive explanation of the concept, including its definition, key characteristics, and how it works.#{1}":[23,26],"#Core Explanation:#Provide a clear, concise, and comprehensive explanation of the concept, including its definition, key characteristics, and how it works.#{2}":[27,28],"#Core Explanation:#Provide a clear, concise, and comprehensive explanation of the concept, including its definition, key characteristics, and how it works.#{3}":[29,30],"#Core Explanation:#Provide a clear, concise, and comprehensive explanation of the concept, including its definition, key characteristics, and how it works.#{4}":[31,32],"#Core Explanation:#Provide a clear, concise, and comprehensive explanation of the concept, including its definition, key characteristics, and how it works.#{5}":[33,34],"#Core Explanation:#Provide a clear, concise, and comprehensive explanation of the concept, including its definition, key characteristics, and how it works.#{6}":[35,37],"#Related Concepts:":[38,52],"#Related Concepts:#{1}":[40,41],"#Related Concepts:#Identify and briefly explain any concepts that are closely related, dependent on, or analogous to the current topic. How do they connect or differ?":[42,52],"#Related Concepts:#Identify and briefly explain any concepts that are closely related, dependent on, or analogous to the current topic. How do they connect or differ?#{1}":[44,45],"#Related Concepts:#Identify and briefly explain any concepts that are closely related, dependent on, or analogous to the current topic. How do they connect or differ?#{2}":[46,47],"#Related Concepts:#Identify and briefly explain any concepts that are closely related, dependent on, or analogous to the current topic. How do they connect or differ?#{3}":[48,49],"#Related Concepts:#Identify and briefly explain any concepts that are closely related, dependent on, or analogous to the current topic. How do they connect or differ?#{4}":[50,52],"#Examples:":[53,67],"#Examples:#{1}":[55,56],"#Examples:#Provide practical code examples that illustrate the concept's application. Ensure the code is well-commented to explain each step and its relevance. The explanation has to be as comments in the code":[57,67],"#Examples:#Provide practical code examples that illustrate the concept's application. Ensure the code is well-commented to explain each step and its relevance. The explanation has to be as comments in the code#{1}":[59,67],"#Flashcards:":[68,112],"#Flashcards:#{1}":[70,71],"#Flashcards:#What is the primary characteristic of a C++ sequence container?;;Elements are stored in a strict linear sequence, and their position depends on the order of insertion, not their value.[[2](https://www.google.com/url?sa=E&q=https%3A%2F%2Fvertexaisearch.cloud.google.com%2Fgrounding-api-redirect%2FAUZIYQHrolcB1JafKUJcyq2acamOWqany17wpoNQQP-6FDmplQgH7C6liLj6Bce2pKYz-En5zbZ8vzfjZynQ9rEnwKEid7AMR3SYTsZQmTb0zhzNnRnyYxCQ856aYYV2m4tC-fue2qt96I8nxqBMJsaPsg%3D%3D)][[7](https://www.google.com/url?sa=E&q=https%3A%2F%2Fvertexaisearch.cloud.google.com%2Fgrounding-api-redirect%2FAUZIYQExK_iWWi2iApZHQWC05mXcFxY9E_re345Nmtcaj30XtAzpOxfJtr-TyYgkol8DGUqbrECfw09-mWz3ezlpmbNNZHysmrmf8c3uHhvEvLsLt9mS105qm0Nd_6H0H0oOTDp_6Y0fDFX1p8Nr7sS2Ud_p4DMsuIbl1u02F1VHFkb_)]":[72,73],"#Flashcards:#Which sequence container is generally the best default choice and why?;;std::vector, because it offers fast random access (O(1)) and efficient additions/removals at the end (amortized O(1)).[[9](https://www.google.com/url?sa=E&q=https%3A%2F%2Fvertexaisearch.cloud.google.com%2Fgrounding-api-redirect%2FAUZIYQHf5b-kfICAdiDFYqOP0fdbNqKyvYP4Up0Bn4B-ALZ-Z6yQASbvuCMhlTPIYFt4ma3maNHlfFNKn-i-SNLCu2xFbJHnTpCc8nalzM9TD0Yd4wuu7hFnhmLMKWwKbmLVRvj5fvCHJvUOCqbrPi5u_YizJ0ncT_D_9AhQzxOcVyvlKCbfWdsqOqtpm_Qjx3Q_TjbhE2Q_m68rTOKa)][[19](https://www.google.com/url?sa=E&q=https%3A%2F%2Fvertexaisearch.cloud.google.com%2Fgrounding-api-redirect%2FAUZIYQG7OIexLZWj8td63DINr1jCFW5Mfij3Y8kwqUdxXSJa75Zu8deYxM8bhSVSsCx68CDwATX04cpfIwQvEJpojYXZlKkv5nGTfVYRG59mww4nvoBtVE3VLOIAFVddZUPejLO9jsPzdyZEAfhjFIDvFBrpDSU-wpAumr20E6tf1oESgHg9n3tzf0oZ4pfh_TI%3D)]":[74,75],"#Flashcards:#When would you prefer to use a std::list over a std::vector?;;When you need to perform frequent insertions and deletions in the middle of the container, as std::list can do this in constant time (O(1)).[[8](https://www.google.com/url?sa=E&q=https%3A%2F%2Fvertexaisearch.cloud.google.com%2Fgrounding-api-redirect%2FAUZIYQE9Cp1OVMpus9hw_LzX9-OuaymVJVMQLyS0Mcni9PB_cYv5VSN4qQVshauawTDWxb73pio3u2nCqxi2mQJxswgYP8avFSubmkfRkC8XWyKF5-459yYN_Ir4ou0im3_j5bEyVh3TGEd1FgCNX27vBkq8r6UatodN6BH_U9hw_835m6pR1LHDWk8E)]":[76,77],"#Flashcards:#What is the main advantage of std::deque over std::vector?;;std::deque allows for efficient insertions and deletions at both the beginning and the end of the container (amortized O(1)).[[10](https://www.google.com/url?sa=E&q=https%3A%2F%2Fvertexaisearch.cloud.google.com%2Fgrounding